&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif" role="img" aria-labelledby="cs-title cs-desc">
<title id="cs-title">Croquis de ciudad snap</title><desc id="cs-desc">Ciudad sintetica con 15 calles, 6 manzanas y 6 puntos de interes. Modo organic-voronoi.</desc>
<style>.cs-root{font-family:var(--cs-font-body);color-scheme:light dark}
.cs-root .cs-canvas{fill:var(--cs-canvas-bg)}
.cs-root .cs-block{stroke-width:0.6;stroke-linejoin:round}
.cs-root .cs-lu-retail{fill:var(--cs-block-retail-fill);stroke:var(--cs-block-retail-stroke);opacity:var(--cs-block-retail-opacity)}
